probe_prompt:
During an afternoon shift at the community garden, Lila opened the supply shed to find a tag hanging from a watering can. The tag said a previous student recorded the answer as 6. Nothing else on it identified the writer or explained the message. Lila watered the herb beds, returned every tool to its hook, and mentioned the tag to the coordinator, who simply added it to a box of other objects found around the garden.

The volume of the cylinder shown is $45\pi$ cubic cm. What is the height in centimeters of the cylinder? [asy]
size(120);
draw(shift(2.2,0)*yscale(0.3)*Circle((0,0), 1.2));

draw((1,0)--(1,-2));
draw((3.4,0)--(3.4,-2));

draw((1,-2)..(2.2,-2.36)..(3.4,-2));

label("$h$",midpoint((3.4,0)--(3.4,-2)),E);

draw (((2.2,0)--(3.4,0)));

label("$r=3$",midpoint((2.2,0)--(3.4,0)),N);

[/asy]

